  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Action Plan to Combat Modern Slavery 2020&#x2013;25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the National Action Plan to Combat Modern Slavery 2020&#x2013;25, the Attorney-General&#x2019;s Department 1) delivers activities in its capacity as Co-Chair (with Indonesia) of the Bali Process Working Group on Trafficking in Persons, to promote more effective and coordinated law and justice responses to trafficking in persons in the Asia-Pacific region and 2) delivers targeted peer-to-peer assistance to support Indo-Pacific partners to develop and implement strengthened legal and policy responses to human trafficking.</narrative>
  </description>
